# Copy to .env and fill in. Do NOT commit .env to git.
#
# Delivery is handled by `hermes send` on the server (→ Feishu) — NO bot token
# needed here; hermes owns the Feishu credentials.
#
# The only (optional) key below is for the LLM-written summary (briefing.py --llm).
# Without it, the briefing falls back to a clean structured plain-text format.

# Optional — only needed for `briefing.py --llm`
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
